Package: ggbumpribbon
Title: Sigmoid-Curved Ribbons for Rank Comparison Charts
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Sondre", "Skarsten", email = "sondreskarsten@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A ggplot2 extension providing sigmoid-curved filled ribbons
    and lines between discrete rank positions. Offers geom_bump_ribbon()
    for filled areas and geom_bump_line() for stroked paths, both using
    logistic sigmoid interpolation. While ggbump provides sigmoid rank
    lines and ggforce provides bezier ribbons, no existing package renders
    sigmoid-curved filled areas positioned at exact rank coordinates.
